+	 * AppleM2ScalerCSCDriver" x676, raw13: x3343; no display session, no
+	 * swap(), black panel): the CSC is the only piece that performs that
+	 * transform. Present the provider canvas instead and let the swapEnd
+	 * copy place it centred on the panel (fOffX/fOffY, clipped in
